{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmmXjvdpsEK2dFDt4uR8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Me, looking at Harel's page\n\n## 1. What I'd do, and how sure I am\n\nI'd move my money into the S&P 500 track (**\"עוקב מדד S&P 500\"**). It's the thing I'd already heard of, and on this page it has the best 5-year number in almost every product. In every product it's around 11.8–11.9% a year over 5 years and around 13.7% over 3 years. Most other tracks I saw are in the 2–9% range. Only the share-heavy tracks (**\"מניות\"**) come close, and only some of them.\n\nThe fee rows I'd look at for the S&P 500 track:\n- **\"קופת גמל להשקעה\"**: 0.56% **\"מהחיסכון\"**, 0% **\"מההפקדות\"**, 13.7% over 3 years, 11.92% over 5 years.\n- **\"קרן השתלמות\"**: 0.5% from savings, **\"אין\"** (none) from deposits, 13.71% and 11.89%. It holds **\"7.9 מיליארד ₪\"**, so lots of people are in it, which reassures me.\n- **\"קרן חדשה מקיפה\"** (pension, I think): 0.16% from savings, but 1.47% from deposits.\n\n**How sure am I?** About 60% sure about choosing the S&P 500 track. Only about 30% sure I'm doing it in the right place. The page never tells me which of these products *my* savings are actually in, so I'd have to call Harel or check my payslip first.\n\n## 2. Parts I actually used\n- The title **\"הראל\"** and the line right under it saying fees are what was really charged in 2025.\n- The row of buttons under **\"כל המוצרים של הראל\"**, mainly to see what products exist (I recognised **\"קרן השתלמות\"**, **\"קופת גמל להשקעה\"** and **\"קרן חדשה מקיפה\"**).\n- The big table: the track names, the fee column and the return column.\n- The grey heading bars for each product, e.g. **\"קרן השתלמות 16 מסלולים · דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.41% עד 0.67%\"**. These were useful as a quick summary.\n- The sentence under the table: **\"התשואה היא תשואת עבר… לפני דמי הניהול ולפני מס\"**.\n\n## 3. Block by block\n- **Top menu** (**\"מדריך\"**, **\"השוואה למטרה\"**…): skipped. I'm here for Harel.\n- **Title and intro text**: used it. **\"123 מקור · 123 מחושב\"** confused me. I didn't get what clicking a number would show me, so I ignored it.\n- **\"כולל את החברות: הראל פנסיה וגמל… הראל קרנות נאמנות\"**: skimmed it.\n- **The product buttons**: used them to see what exists. But the button says **\"כל המוצרים 105\"** and the text below says **\"96 מסלולים ב־7 מוצרים\"**. I count 9 buttons, so which number is right?\n- **The main table**: used it, but it is *very* long. I scrolled through about 9 screens of rows that look almost the same. Inside each product the order is by fee, so the S&P 500 track was in a different place each time and I had to hunt for it.\n- **The grey product bars**: used them. They told me which product I was in, until they scrolled away. Then I lost track (around screens 4–5 I wasn't sure if I was still in **\"קרן השתלמות\"** or something else).\n- **\"תגמולים ואישית לפיציים\"**: confused me. I have no idea what that is or whether it's mine.\n- **\"חיסכון לכל ילד\"**: skipped. I don't have kids.\n- **\"מרכזית לפיצויים\"**: skipped. I don't know what it is.\n- **The notes at the bottom of the table** (**\"אין: בסוג הקופה הזה מותר לגבות…\"**, **\"PF-06\"**, **\"PF-10\"**): skimmed. The codes mean nothing to me.\n- **\"קרנות מחקות\"** and **\"קרנות סל\"**: confused me. The S&P 500 options here (**\"הראל מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\"**) look much cheaper: **\"0% קבועים, 0.1% משתנים, 0.025% נאמן\"**. But I don't know if those are the same kind of thing as my savings, or if I can even move my money there.\n- **\"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\"** (the list you open with arrows): skipped. It looks like legal documents.\n- **\"לא מצאתם שם?\"** (the search box): skipped. I'd only need it if the name in my app is different.\n- **Footer**: skipped.\n\n## 4. In the tables\n- **What I looked at:**\n  - **\"המסלול\"**: the names. I searched for **\"S&P 500\"** and **\"מניות\"**.\n  - **\"דמי ניהול… מהחיסכון\"**: the top number.\n  - **\"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\"**: I mostly compared the **\"5 שנים\"** line, because it's the longer period.\n  - **\"כסף מנוהל\"**: only to feel safe (\"a lot of money is there\").\n- **What I ignored:**\n  - **\"קופה\"**: the numbers like 15283 and the little icon next to them.\n  - The **\"מההפקדות\"** line. I noticed it was 0% or **\"אין\"** almost everywhere, and only paid attention when it jumped to 1.47%.\n  - The **donut charts**, and the **teal and yellow dots** for **\"מניות\"** and **\"מט\"ח\"**. I don't know what a full yellow ring is supposed to tell me.\n  - The small **sort arrows** next to the headings.\n  - The **coloured tags** in the fund tables: **\"צוברת\"**, **\"חשיפה לדולר\"**, **\"כמה דרכים יחד\"**, **\"מס גם על שינויי המטבע\"**.\n- **\"פחות מ־3 שנים\"**: half the rows say this instead of a number. I took it to mean \"too new, no result\", so I ignored those tracks.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n- What **\"מהחיסכון\"** vs **\"מההפקדות\"** means in real money. Is 0.16% + 1.47% cheaper or more expensive than 0.56% + 0%?\n- **\"אין\"** vs **\"0%\"**: are they the same thing?\n- **\"מט\"ח\"**, and why a track can be 99% shares and 99% foreign currency at the same time.\n- **\"לפני דמי ניהול\"**: so do I subtract the fee myself to get my real return?\n- **\"קבועים / משתנים / נאמן\"**, **\"4A / 4D\"**, and **\"צוברת\"**.\n- **\"עוד לא דווח\"**, **\"הלכה יהודית\"** (I guessed it's religious), **\"גמיש\"** and **\"קיימות\"**.\n- What makes **\"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים\"** or **\"מרכזית לפיצויים\"** different from the others.\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n- **Which product I actually have.** Pension? Training fund? Both?\n- **What these fees mean in shekels for me**, e.g. \"on ₪50,000 you'd pay about ₪X a year\".\n- **How to switch tracks**, and whether switching costs money or triggers tax.\n- **Can I move my savings into the cheap S&P 500 funds** under **\"קרנות מחקות\"**, or is that a completely different thing?\n- **A simple way to see just the S&P 500 track** in every product side by side, without scrolling through all the rows.\n- **What happened in bad years.** The page shows averages only, so I can't see how much it dropped at its worst.\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go\n1. **\"מה כתוב במסמכים של הראל\"** (the documents list).\n2. **\"חיסכון לכל ילד\"** and **\"מרכזית לפיצויים\"**.\n3. The **donut charts** and the **\"מניות / מט\"ח\"** percentages.\n4. The **\"קופה\"** number column, and the **PF-06 / PF-10** notes.\n5. All the tracks that say **\"פחות מ־3 שנים\"** on both lines. They give me nothing to compare.\n6. The **\"לא מצאתם שם?\"** search box and **\"123 מקור / 123 מחושב\"**.\n\nI'd keep the names, the fee from savings, the 5-year return, and the grey product bars."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10917,"cache_read_input_tokens":16423,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10917},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"36745cc6-ab60-45d0-a90c-7e777210349a","uuid":"e69bde6d-f49b-4f78-8ef6-479b479f74f4","timestamp":"2026-11-06T13:40:37.081Z","request_id":"req_011CgmmXhiSJA8Jqze1RkWkk"}
